# Settings for binlist-data.csv.
#
# They live here rather than in the file so the dataset stays byte-for-byte as
# published: a diff against upstream is how anyone checks it has not been
# tampered with, and CC BY asks that modifications be declared.
#
# Trusted below a hand-maintained list, on the publisher's own description of
# it: "not an official IIN register", "compiled by scraping", "use at your own
# risk", and archived read-only since December 2020. It is broad, useful, and
# six years stale. Where it disagrees with a list you curate, yours is the
# answer and this is recorded as the dissent.
# bintel: confidence = 0.5
